# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): Tick held on headphones with the drones low (E1 and B1, the subs two
# octaves down), lightly then hard, then let go: the headphone low cut (2026-11-15) keeps its sub under 1 Hz from
# pinning the output's clip. And the header's gesture where the room is tight: TICK beside "P2 EMBERS" on Tone (the
# draw had kept a pixel more than the layout), CHORD and STUTTER by name alone on Pitch moves and Sub · Drive. Not a
# test of its own (no expectations).
notips
phones 1
set 74 0
set 71 0
pressure w8 0
pressure w9 0
pressure w11 0
set 0 2800
set 21 3500
set 6 2
set 27 2
tap PLAY
wav tick-low.wav
wait 3000
key w8 down
pressure w8 60
wait 5000
pressure w8 127
wait 5000
pressure w8 0
key w8 up
wait 5000
wavstop
tapkey w1
wait 2000
set 55 1
page 3
wait 500
key w8 down
pressure w8 100
wait 1500
shot tick-tone.png
pressure w8 0
key w8 up
wait 9000
page 9
key w9 down
pressure w9 100
wait 1500
shot chord-moves.png
pressure w9 0
key w9 up
wait 9000
page 5
key w11 down
pressure w11 100
wait 1500
shot stutter-sub.png
pressure w11 0
key w11 up
